<li class="comment even thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-1024357">
	<article class="flow-root" itemprop="comment" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Comment">
		<div class="comment-image">
			<img data-pin-nopin="nopin" loading="lazy" nopin="nopin" alt="Pinch of Yum Logo" src="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bc725c8cdf1dfa89582787da1c697f251f4098c2f54974036f91721ffb3daa36?s=75&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-75x75.jpg&#038;r=g" srcset="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bc725c8cdf1dfa89582787da1c697f251f4098c2f54974036f91721ffb3daa36?s=150&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-150x150.jpg&#038;r=g 2x" class='avatar avatar-75 photo' height='75' width='75' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>		</div>
		<div class="comment-content">
			<div class="comment-author vcard" itemprop="author" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
				<meta itemprop="name" content="Supriya Kutty"/>
				<cite class="fn"><a href="https://www.quichentell.com/" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Supriya Kutty</a></cite>			</div>
						<div class="comment-text w-full" itemprop="text"><p>This looks like the perfect quick and comforting meal — I love how you show that delicious ramen doesn’t need to take hours. The step-by-step recipe feels easy to follow, and the combination of broth, veggies, and noodles looks so satisfying. Ramen this accessible and flavorful is exactly what busy weeknights need. Thanks for sharing such a practical and tasty idea — I can’t wait to try it.</p>
</div><p class="tasty-recipes-ratings"><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="5"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="5"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="5"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="5"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="5"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span></p>
