						<div class="comment-text w-full" itemprop="text"><p>I&#8217;ve been eating instant ramen for as long as I can remember.  Why did I not find you sooner?  This is an amazingly easy recipe packed full of punchy flavours!!!  I added chicken to water and boiled it for stock then shredded it.  Afiyet olsun! From Turkiye ☺️</p>
