<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1" id="comment-1007936">
	<article class="flow-root" itemprop="comment" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Comment">
		<div class="comment-image">
			<img data-pin-nopin="nopin" loading="lazy" nopin="nopin" alt="Pinch of Yum Logo" src="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/48806099389a29f8c16afce961a68f0c81629853632001a1e2270dbaea693a83?s=75&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-75x75.jpg&#038;r=g" srcset="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/48806099389a29f8c16afce961a68f0c81629853632001a1e2270dbaea693a83?s=150&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-150x150.jpg&#038;r=g 2x" class='avatar avatar-75 photo' height='75' width='75' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>		</div>
		<div class="comment-content">
			<div class="comment-author vcard" itemprop="author" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
				<meta itemprop="name" content="Ann"/>
				<cite class="fn">Ann</cite>			</div>
						<div class="comment-text w-full" itemprop="text"><p>I questioned the 1:1 ratio of water and broth when cooking this recipe, and I wish I stuck to my gut because the final broth tasted like dirty water . It unfortunately wasn’t flavorful at all until we topped it aggressively with soy sauce, sriracha, red pepper flakes, etc. But then it was kinda just spicy water at that point. I gave it two stars because it does have potential but needs a lot of tweaking and a lot less water.</p>
</div><p class="tasty-recipes-ratings"><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="2"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="2"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="2"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="2"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="2"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span></p>
