<li class="comment odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-992195">
	<article class="flow-root" itemprop="comment" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Comment">
		<div class="comment-image">
			<img data-pin-nopin="nopin" loading="lazy" nopin="nopin" alt="Pinch of Yum Logo" src="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7741ff91a40d8ee35d581393fc1857f5ed4ed0756c08b0a98cfd526487114edf?s=75&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-75x75.jpg&#038;r=g" srcset="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7741ff91a40d8ee35d581393fc1857f5ed4ed0756c08b0a98cfd526487114edf?s=150&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-150x150.jpg&#038;r=g 2x" class='avatar avatar-75 photo' height='75' width='75' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>		</div>
		<div class="comment-content">
			<div class="comment-author vcard" itemprop="author" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
				<meta itemprop="name" content="Liz"/>
				<cite class="fn">Liz</cite>			</div>
						<div class="comment-text w-full" itemprop="text"><p>This was terrible. No flavor, and super frustrating to see all the 4+ star ratings and then mediocre reviews, or the repeat of &#8220;it was bland&#8221;. This was awful &#8211; I got to the mushroom stage, boiled for 10mins, and the whole thing tasted like dirty water. Had to add soy sauce, fish sauce, vinegar, loads more garlic just to get some kind of flavor. Not repeating this recipe and it is NOT a 4* recipe for me.</p>
</div><p class="tasty-recipes-ratings"><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="1"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="1"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="1"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="1"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="1"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span></p>
			<div class="comment-meta commentmetadata">
				<meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2025-03-22T19:10:07-05:00"/>
				<a href="https://pinchofyum.com/quick-homemade-ramen#comment-992195">03/22/25 @ 7:10 pm</a>
											</div>
			<div class="comment-reply">
				<a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-992195" data-commentid="992195" data-postid="16598" data-belowelement="comment-992195" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Liz" aria-label="Reply to Liz">Reply</a>			</div>
