						<div class="comment-text w-full" itemprop="text"><p>I found the broth rather bland. Adding chili oil or hot sauce wasn&#8217;t an option; I don&#8217;t like the spice. I added powered Shiitake mushroom and plenty of tamari sauce but with the addition of &#8220;hot&#8221; spices,  the soup was disappointing.</p>
