<li class="comment odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="comment-989090">
	<article class="flow-root" itemprop="comment" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Comment">
		<div class="comment-image">
			<img data-pin-nopin="nopin" loading="lazy" nopin="nopin" alt="Pinch of Yum Logo" src="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/899de11be773c6e6d5cf5ba3f3347c6d2d73cc00b6202420bf0d9efa37106f4e?s=75&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-75x75.jpg&#038;r=g" srcset="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/899de11be773c6e6d5cf5ba3f3347c6d2d73cc00b6202420bf0d9efa37106f4e?s=150&#038;d=https%3A%2F%2Fpinchofyum.com%2Fcontent%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fpoy-avatar-grey-150x150.jpg&#038;r=g 2x" class='avatar avatar-75 photo' height='75' width='75' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>		</div>
		<div class="comment-content">
			<div class="comment-author vcard" itemprop="author" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
				<meta itemprop="name" content="Russianbluecat"/>
				<cite class="fn"><a href="https://russianbluekittensforsale.com/" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Russianbluecat</a></cite>			</div>
						<div class="comment-text w-full" itemprop="text"><p>I tried this recipe today, and it was such a game-changer! I loved how simple yet flavorful the broth turned out with the garlic, ginger, and shiitake mushrooms. The toppings really took it to the next level the soft-boiled egg was a nice touch! It&#8217;s a perfect way to elevate a quick ramen dish. I also appreciated how customizable it was with veggies like kale and carrots. Definitely bookmarking this one for future ramen cravings!</p>
</div><p class="tasty-recipes-ratings"><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="4"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="4"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="4"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="100" data-rating="4"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span><span class="tasty-recipes-rating tasty-recipes-rating-outline" data-tr-clip="0" data-rating="4"><svg role="presentation" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="#wpt-star-full"></use></svg></span></p>
